            "text": "<p><strong>Presale </strong>☎️<strong>Hotline: +1(281)777-8190</strong></p><p><strong>Calling Open Time: ET 11:00AM-8:00PM (Mon-Fri)</strong></p><p><strong>Contact Email: service@wellfittreadmill.com<br/><br/></strong></p>"
